msgid "Starter content for a driver recruitment page, with [CONFIRM] notes for pay and conditions."
msgstr "司机招聘页面的初始内容，薪酬和工作条件处附有 [CONFIRM] 提示。"

msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Complaints & feedback page"
msgstr "投诉和反馈页面"

msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "A clear complaints process with steps, response times ([CONFIRM]) and how to escalate to regulators."
msgstr "清晰的投诉流程，包括步骤、回复时限（[CONFIRM]）以及如何向监管机构申诉。"

msgid "What happens next"
msgstr "接下来会怎样"

msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Privacy policy page"
msgstr "隐私政策页面"

msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Privacy policy that follows the Australian Privacy Principles and updates from your settings, with a request form."
msgstr "遵循《澳大利亚隐私原则》并根据您的设置自动更新的隐私政策，附申请表。"

msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Seasonal / event landing page"
msgstr "季节性 / 活动着陆页"

msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Landing page for an event or season (footy finals, Christmas, spring racing). Schedule it with Publish → Schedule and set \"Unpublish automatically\"."
msgstr "用于某项活动或季节的着陆页（澳式足球决赛、圣诞节、春季赛马）。请通过“发布 → 定时”安排上线时间，并设置“自动取消发布”。"

msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Terms & cancellation policy page"
msgstr "条款和取消政策页面"

msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Structured draft for your booking terms and cancellation policy, with [CONFIRM] notes where your real policy is needed."
msgstr "预约条款和取消政策的结构化草稿，需要填写您实际政策的地方附有 [CONFIRM] 提示。"

msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Partner logos"
msgstr "合作伙伴标志"

msgctxt "Pattern description"
