msgstr "侧边栏"

msgid "Book online in two minutes or call our team."
msgstr "两分钟在线预约，或致电我们的团队。"

msgid "Categories"
msgstr "分类"

#. translators: 1: suburb, 2: site name
msgid "Need an accessible ride in %1$s? %2$s provides wheelchair accessible taxis with ramps or hoists, wheelchair restraints and drivers trained to help you in and out safely."
msgstr "在 %1$s 需要无障碍出行？%2$s 提供无障碍轮椅出租车，配备坡道或升降机和轮椅固定带，司机经过培训，可以安全地协助您上下车。"

#. translators: %s: suburb
msgid "We pick up from homes, hospitals, aged-care residences and day programs in %s and take you anywhere across Melbourne and the Mornington Peninsula — including Melbourne and Avalon airports."
msgstr "我们可从 %s 的住家、医院、养老院和日间活动中心接您，送您前往墨尔本和莫宁顿半岛的任何地方——包括墨尔本机场和阿瓦隆（Avalon）机场。"

#. translators: %s: suburb
msgid "Places we often travel to around %s"
msgstr "%s 周边我们常去的地方"

