msgstr "预约步骤"

msgid "Your trip"
msgstr "您的行程"

msgid "Street address, suburb"
msgstr "街道地址，区名"

msgid "e.g. Frankston Hospital, Melbourne Airport"
msgstr "例如：Frankston 医院、墨尔本机场"

msgid "Estimate only, based on the usual driving route. The final fare depends on traffic, waiting time and route, and any MPTP subsidy is applied by the driver."
msgstr "仅为估算，根据通常的行车路线计算。最终车费取决于交通状况、等候时间和路线，MPTP 补贴（如有）由司机计算扣除。"

msgid "I need a return trip"
msgstr "我需要回程"

msgid "Return pick-up time (if known)"
msgstr "回程上车时间（如已确定）"

msgid "This is a regular trip (e.g. dialysis, therapy, day program)"
msgstr "这是定期行程（例如透析、治疗、日间活动）"

msgid "Repeat every"
msgstr "每周重复于"

msgid "Until"
msgstr "截至"

#. translators: %d: weeks
msgid "Same times each day, for up to %d weeks. Each trip gets its own reference so it can be changed separately."
msgstr "每天时间相同，最长 %d 周。每次行程都有自己的预约编号，可以单独更改。"

msgid "Accessibility needs"
msgstr "无障碍需求"

msgid "I am a Multi Purpose Taxi Program (MPTP) member"
msgstr "我是多用途出租车计划（MPTP）会员"

msgid "Anything we should know?"
msgstr "还有什么需要我们知道的吗？"

msgid "e.g. wheelchair dimensions, carer travelling, assistance to the door, flight number"
msgstr "例如：轮椅尺寸、有护理人员同行、需协助到门口、航班号"

msgid "How will you pay?"
msgstr "您打算如何付款？"

msgid "Plan manager, provider or company"
msgstr "计划管理人、服务提供者或公司"

msgid "NDIS number or purchase order (optional)"
msgstr "NDIS 号码或采购订单号（选填）"

msgid "After you submit, you will be taken to Stripe’s secure checkout to pay the deposit. The rest of the fare is paid at the end of the trip."
msgstr "提交后，您将被转到 Stripe 的安全付款页面支付订金。其余车费在行程结束时支付。"

msgid "Your details"
msgstr "您的资料"

msgid "I agree to be contacted by phone, SMS or email about this booking, and for you to use the mobility and health details I give to arrange the trip."
msgstr "我同意你们就此预约通过电话、短信或电子邮件与我联系，并同意你们使用我提供的行动能力和健康信息来安排行程。"

#. translators: %s: link to the terms page
msgid "I have read and accept the %s."
msgstr "我已阅读并接受%s。"

msgid "terms and cancellation policy"
msgstr "条款和取消政策"

msgid "Request booking"
msgstr "提交预约申请"

#. translators: %s: phone link
msgid "Travelling in the next hour? Call %s"
msgstr "一小时内出行？请致电 %s"

msgid "Find your booking"
msgstr "查找您的预约"

msgid "Enter the reference from your confirmation (it starts with TP-) and the mobile number you booked with."
msgstr "请输入确认信息中的预约编号（以 TP- 开头）以及预约时使用的手机号码。"

msgid "Show my booking"
msgstr "显示我的预约"

#. translators: %s: phone link
msgid "Lost your reference? Call %s."
msgstr "找不到预约编号？请致电 %s。"

msgid "Online deposit"
msgstr "在线订金"

msgid "Thanks — we have received your request."
msgstr "谢谢——我们已收到您的申请。"

msgid "Our team will contact you to confirm."
msgstr "我们的团队会与您联系确认。"

msgid "Payment complete — thank you."
msgstr "付款完成——谢谢您。"

msgid "It can take a minute for the payment to show below."
msgstr "付款可能需要一分钟左右才会显示在下方。"

msgid "The payment was not completed. You can try again below or pay the driver."
msgstr "付款未完成。您可以在下方重试，或向司机付款。"

msgid "This booking has been cancelled."
msgstr "此预约已取消。"

msgid "Our driver arrived but could not find you, so this trip was marked as a no-show. Please call us if this is a mistake."
msgstr "我们的司机已到达，但没有找到您，因此本次行程被记录为“乘客未到”。如有误会，请致电我们。"

msgid "Your driver is on the way."
msgstr "您的司机正在路上。"

msgid "Your driver has arrived."
msgstr "您的司机已到达。"

msgid "Booking progress"
msgstr "预约进度"

msgid "Time to be arranged"
msgstr "时间待定"

#. translators: 1: passengers, 2: wheelchairs
msgid "%1$d passenger(s), %2$d wheelchair(s)"
msgstr "%1$d 位乘客，%2$d 台轮椅"

msgid "estimate only"
msgstr "仅为估算"

msgid "Your notes"
msgstr "您的备注"

#. translators: %s: amount
msgid "Pay %s deposit securely"
msgstr "安全支付 %s 订金"

#. translators: %d: number of trips
msgid "This is part of a repeat booking (%d trips)"
msgstr "这是重复预约中的一次行程（共 %d 次）"

#. translators: %s: request type
msgid "Your %s is with our team. We will contact you shortly."
msgstr "您的%s已转交我们的团队。我们会尽快与您联系。"

msgid "Change or cancel this booking"
msgstr "更改或取消此预约"

msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr "您想做什么？"

msgid "Change the time, address or details"
msgstr "更改时间、地址或详情"

msgid "Cancel this trip"
msgstr "取消此行程"

msgid "Cancel all remaining trips in this repeat booking"
msgstr "取消此重复预约中所有剩余的行程"

msgid "e.g. Please change the pick-up to 10:15am"
msgstr "例如：请把上车时间改为上午 10:15"

msgid "Requests are handled by our team. For changes within the next two hours, please call us."
msgstr "申请由我们的团队处理。如需更改两小时内的行程，请致电我们。"

#. translators: %s: phone link
msgid "Questions about your trip? Call %s."
msgstr "对行程有疑问？请致电 %s。"

msgid "Thanks — your booking request is in!"
msgstr "谢谢——您的预约申请已提交！"

msgid "Your reference"
msgstr "您的预约编号"

#. translators: %d: number of trips
msgid "%d trip has been requested."
msgid_plural "%d trips have been requested."
msgstr[0] "已申请 %d 次行程。"

msgid "Each trip has its own reference, listed in your confirmation email."
msgstr "每次行程都有自己的预约编号，列在您的确认电子邮件中。"

msgid "We saved your booking but could not open the online payment page. You can pay the driver instead, or try again from your booking page."
msgstr "我们已保存您的预约，但无法打开在线付款页面。您可以改为向司机付款，或在预约页面重试。"

msgid "We confirm your booking"
msgstr "我们确认您的预约"

msgid "By SMS or email — usually within the hour during opening times."
msgstr "通过短信或电子邮件——营业时间内通常在一小时内确认。"

msgid "Your driver is assigned"
msgstr "为您指派司机"

msgid "We text you their first name and the vehicle."
msgstr "我们会用短信告诉您司机的名字和车辆。"

msgid "On the day"
msgstr "出行当天"

