msgstr "上门接送"

msgid "Our maxi taxis back up close, lower the ramp and help you aboard. You stay in your own chair, secured with four-point restraints."
msgstr "我们的大型出租车会倒车靠近，放下坡道并扶您上车。您可以一直坐在自己的轮椅上，并用四点式固定带固定。"

msgid "Book a pickup"
msgstr "预约接送"

msgid "Airport drop-offs & pickups"
msgstr "机场送机和接机"

msgid "Straight to Departures, and waiting at Arrivals when you land — with room for luggage and mobility equipment."
msgstr "直接送到出发大厅，您落地时我们在到达大厅等候——还有足够空间放行李和助行设备。"

